{"ts": 1791255100.777456, "type": "step", "step": 14, "action": "reader_peek_section", "args": {"path": "/course/readings/week3/evaluation.md", "section": "*"}, "output": "# Evaluating agents\n\n## pass@k vs pass^k\npass@k: any of k runs succeeds. pass^k: all k succeed. Reliability is what deployment needs.\n\n## Proxy vs direct measures\nA quiz score is a proxy. Retention a week later is closer to the thing itself.\n", "t": 0, "activity": [], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.17476759445489312, "pomdp": 0.17476759445489312, "pass_k": 0.17476759445489312}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9326300046159877, "motivation": 0.8147028832022861, "reliance": 0.48500382521680074, "persistence": 0.41823273111755155, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.32174026877242917, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.36461343048320694, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 0.0, "seen_posts": []}}
{"ts": 1791255100.7780411, "type": "step", "step": 15, "action": "reader_peek_section", "args": {"path": "/course/readings/week3/environments.md", "section": "*"}, "output": "# Agent environments\n\n## What an environment is\nState, observations, actions, dynamics. The reward is a separate claim about what matters.\n\n## Partial observability (POMDP)\nWhen the agent cannot see the full state it must maintain a belief and sometimes act to gather information. Measurement can be an action with a cost.\n\n## Attention as a hidden variable\nLearners do not read everything shown to them. Attention gates learning and drains with fatigue.\n", "t": 0, "activity": [], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.17476759445489312, "pomdp": 0.17476759445489312, "pass_k": 0.17476759445489312}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9326300046159877, "motivation": 0.8147028832022861, "reliance": 0.48500382521680074, "persistence": 0.41823273111755155, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.32174026877242917, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.36461343048320694, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 0.0, "seen_posts": []}}
