{"ts": 1791255102.314582, "type": "step", "step": 19, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "I found the Week 3 readings. The build wants two things: (1) a clear environment definition \u2014 state, observations, actions, and dynamics; and (2) an evaluation using pass^k on at least 3 seeds. We should also think about the partial observability/attention point because it\u2019s in the reading. First, please skim the two sections I\u2019ll assign, then I\u2019ll help you turn them into your write-up and plan the evaluation.", "intent": "explain", "concept": "week3-build"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: can you just tell me the answer\n[activity] t=10 messages 4m", "t": 14, "activity": [{"t": 10, "app": "messages", "minutes": 4, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.17476759445489312, "pomdp": 0.3488293054837408, "pass_k": 0.4292264794810081}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.865963337949321, "motivation": 0.8147028832022861, "reliance": 0.48500382521680074, "persistence": 0.41823273111755155, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.32174026877242917, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.36461343048320694, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.0, "seen_posts": []}}
{"ts": 1791255103.567014, "type": "step", "step": 20, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Yes \u2014 here\u2019s the short answer: pass^k means **all k runs must succeed**. So in your write-up, report it as the fraction of seeds for which every one of the k attempts passed. If you have 3 seeds, you can write something like: \u201cpass^k over 3 seeds = X/3.\u201d If you want, I can help you phrase the evaluation section right now.", "intent": "give_answer", "concept": "week3-eval"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: ok got it, thanks\n[activity] t=14 messages 1m", "t": 15, "activity": [{"t": 14, "app": "messages", "minutes": 1, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.17476759445489312, "pomdp": 0.3488293054837408, "pass_k": 0.4369543119976677}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.75}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.865963337949321, "motivation": 0.8147028832022861, "reliance": 0.5650038252168007, "persistence": 0.3882327311175515, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.32174026877242917, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.36461343048320694, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.7, "seen_posts": []}}
{"ts": 1791255105.024479, "type": "step", "step": 21, "action": "notes_append", "args": {"note_id": "writeup", "text": "\n\n## Evaluation\npass^k means **all k runs must succeed**. For this build, I should report pass^k on at least 3 seeds, i.e. the fraction of seeds for which all k attempts passed. Example phrasing: \u201cpass^k over 3 seeds = X/3.\u201d"}, "output": "Appended.", "t": 15, "activity": [], "events": [{"type": "note_edit", "note_id": "writeup", "by": "agent"}], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.17476759445489312, "pomdp": 0.3488293054837408, "pass_k": 0.4369543119976677}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.75}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.865963337949321, "motivation": 0.8147028832022861, "reliance": 0.5650038252168007, "persistence": 0.3882327311175515, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.32174026877242917, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.36461343048320694, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.7, "seen_posts": []}}
{"ts": 1791255105.025485, "type": "step", "step": 22, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Nice \u2014 since you\u2019ve got pass^k now, let\u2019s finish the build by tightening the write-up. Next step: make your environment definition complete by including observations and dynamics, not just state and actions. Then in Evaluation, state the exact pass^k result over at least 3 seeds and define what counts as a success for one run. If you want, I can help you draft those two sections in one pass.", "intent": "nudge", "concept": "week3-build"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: can you just tell me the answer\n[activity] t=15 messages 1m", "t": 16, "activity": [{"t": 15, "app": "messages", "minutes": 1, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.17476759445489312, "pomdp": 0.3488293054837408, "pass_k": 0.4369543119976677}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.75}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.865963337949321, "motivation": 0.7647028832022861, "reliance": 0.5650038252168007, "persistence": 0.3882327311175515, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.32174026877242917, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.36461343048320694, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.19, "seen_posts": []}}
{"ts": 1791255106.227873, "type": "step", "step": 23, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Here\u2019s the direct answer: in this build, **pass^k** means **all k trials must pass** for a given seed. So your evaluation should report something like: \u201cpass^k on 3 seeds = 2/3\u201d if all k attempts succeeded on 2 of the 3 seeds. If you want the safest wording for the write-up, say: \u201cWe measure reliability with pass^k, where a seed counts as successful only if all k runs pass.\u201d", "intent": "give_answer", "concept": "week3-eval"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: makes sense. what next?\n[activity] t=16 idle 1m", "t": 17, "activity": [{"t": 16, "app": "idle", "minutes": 1, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.17476759445489312, "pomdp": 0.3488293054837408, "pass_k": 0.4369543119976677}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.75}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.869963337949321, "motivation": 0.7647028832022861, "reliance": 0.5650038252168007, "persistence": 0.3882327311175515, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.32174026877242917, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.36461343048320694, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 1, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 1.0, "nag": 2.533, "seen_posts": []}}
